#: ardour_ui.cc:2982
msgid ""
"<b>MMCSS priority can not be set!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Windows Multimedia Class Scheduler Service (MCSS) is used for time-critical "
"audio processing. By default, Microsoft has limited the number of MMCSS "
"threads to 32, and this limit has been reached.\n"
"\n"
"You can reduce the number of process threads in Preferences &gt; "
"Performance, but that may be insufficient, because MCSS threads are also "
"used for Audio and MIDI I/O.\n"
"One solution is to increase the number of available MCSS threads by "
"modifying the windows registry. A tool to do that conveniently can be found "
"<a href=\"https://helpcenter.steinberg.de/hc/en-us/articles/13338094735762-"
"Error-message-on-Windows-MMCSS-priority-cannot-be-set\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"<b>MMCSS-prioritet kan inte ställas in!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Windows Multimedia Class Scheduler Service (MCSS) används för tidskritisk "
"ljudbearbetning. Som standard har Microsoft begränsat antalet MMCSS-trådar "
"till 32, och denna gräns har nåtts.\n"
"\n"
"Du kan minska antalet processtrådar i Inställningar & Prestanda, men det kan "
"vara otillräckligt eftersom MCSS-trådar också används för ljud- och MIDI-I/"
"O.\n"
"En lösning är att öka antalet tillgängliga MCSS-trådar genom att ändra "
"Windows-registret. Ett verktyg för att göra det bekvämt kan hittas <a href=\\"
"\"https://helpcenter.steinberg.de/hc/en-us/articles/13338094735762-Error-"
"message-on-Windows-MMCSS-priority-cannot-be-set\\\">här</a>."

